        <item>
            <title>3.30.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:22:56 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>235</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.30.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Long jobs show their finish time. A session can register a job it started (a training run, a render, a batch) with `canopyctl job watch`; Canopy then checks its progress every few minutes, locally or over ssh, without using the model, and the sidebar row shows a progress ring around the session's dot with the finish time and percent on the right. Hover for the count and the time left.
- A job that stops making progress turns the row red and moves it to Needs you; a finished job marks the session as unseen. Each sends one push to the phone.
- The phone's roster now shows the same progress and finish time, and the same one-line summary of what a session is asking or last said.
- Sessions learn when and how to register a job, and are reminded once after starting a long-running command.
]]></description>
